  "title": "Trex Showcases The Future Of Outdoor Living At IBS 2026",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va. (February 16, 2026) – From wildfire risk and extreme heat to moisture-heavy and coastal conditions, today’s builders and homeowners face a growing list of environmental challenges. At IBS 2026, Trex Company [NYSE:TREX] will demonstrate how its expanding lineup of Performance-Engineered™ outdoor living solutions empowers professionals to confidently deliver durable, code-compliant outdoor spaces in every environment.",
